+# deliveries, guarding pushes and watching the perimeter are one role wearing
+# three names rather than three separate things. This file kept the old name
+# after that change landed, which is exactly the failure the construction
+# theme exists to catch: a name that no longer describes what runs.
 #
-# So this runs on a GitHub-hosted runner, where the estate cannot starve it. It
