-# stored outside the estate, which is a worse trade than the blindness it buys.
+# "Canary" stays as the word for the PATTERN, because it is a real term of
+# art and renaming it away would obscure rather than clarify - this still is
+# a dead-man's-switch, watched from outside, for the same reason a canary is
+# carried into a mine rather than tested at the entrance. What changed is
+# only which noun names the workflow: gatehouse patrol, not canary.
+#
+# Everything else that reports on this estate runs inside it, and all of it
